  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "なぞの　おおい　たんけんきのなかでトドロクツキという　なで　しるされたせいぶつの　かのうせいが　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수수께끼로 가득한 탐험기에 “고동치는달”이라는 이름으로 기록된 생물일 가능성이 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠有可能就是在謎團重重的探險記裡，以轟鳴月這個名字被記載下來的生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il pourrait s’agir de la créature nommée « Rugit-Lune », qui apparaît dans un récit d’exploration très mystérieux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Möglicherweise handelt es sich hierbei um jene Kreatur, die in einem rätselhaften Expeditions- bericht als Donnersichel erwähnt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Podría tratarse de la criatura que aparece bajo el nombre de Bramaluna en cierto diario repleto de incógnitas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È possibile che si tratti della creatura catalogata come \"Lunaruggente\" in un diario di viaggio colmo di misteri.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is possible that this is the creature listed as Roaring Moon in an expedition journal that still holds many mysteries.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "謎の　多い　探検記の中でトドロクツキという　名で　記された生物の　可能性が　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它有可能就是谜团重重的探险记中被记载为轰鸣月这个名字的生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Podría tratarse de la criatura que aparece bajo el nombre de Bramaluna en cierto diario repleto de incógnitas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あやしい　ざっしの　きじによるとある　ちほうで　おこる　げんしょうにかんれんする　ポケモンらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "괴상한 잡지의 기사에 의하면 어떤 지방에서 일어나는 현상과 관련 있는 포켓몬이라고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "根據可疑雜誌的報導來看，這種寶可夢好像跟某個地區會發生的現象有關連。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
